<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A1416051002">
<title>
Connecting Rod Bearing General Information
</title>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Service connecting rod bearings are available in standard size and 0.25 mm (0.0098 in.) undersize, and standard size bearing has five kinds of bearings differing in tolerance.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
For identification of undersize bearing, it is painted red at the position as shown in figure. Undersize bearing thickness is 1.6050 – 1.6150 mm (0.06319 – 0.06358 in.) at its center.
</ptxt>
